#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:10
msgid "Sourceforge"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:12
msgid ""
"``SourceforgePackage`` is a `mixin-class <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Mixin>`_. It automatically sets the URL based on a list of Sourceforge "
"mirrors listed in `sourceforge_mirror_path`, which defaults to a half dozen "
"known mirrors. Refer to the package source (`<https://github.com/spack/spack/"
"blob/develop/lib/spack/spack/build_systems/sourceforge.py>`__) for the "
"current list of mirrors used by Spack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:22
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:24
msgid "This package provides a method for populating mirror URLs."
msgstr "此套件提供了一種填入鏡像網址的方法。"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:26
msgid "**urls**"
msgstr "**網址**"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:28
msgid ""
"This method returns a list of possible URLs for package source. It is "
"decorated with `property` so its results are treated as a package attribute."
msgstr ""
"此方法返回一個可能的套件源網址列表。它是用 `property` 修飾的，因此其結果被視"
"為套件屬性。"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:32
msgid ""
"Refer to `<https://spack.readthedocs.io/en/latest/packaging_guide."
"html#mirrors-of-the-main-url>`__ for information on how Spack uses the "
"`urls` attribute during fetching."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:39
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:41
msgid ""
"This helper package can be added to your package by adding it as a base "
"class of your package and defining the relative location of an archive file "
"for one version of your software."
msgstr ""
"通過將此輔助套件作為套件的基礎類並定義一個版本的軟體檔案的相對位置，可以將其"
"添加到您的套件中。"

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:45
msgid ""
" class MyPackage(AutotoolsPackage, SourceforgePackage):\n"
"     ...\n"
"     sourceforge_mirror_path = \"my-package/mypackage.1.0.0.tar.gz\"\n"
"     ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../build_systems/sourceforgepackage.rst:53
msgid ""
"Over 40 packages are using ``SourceforcePackage`` this mix-in as of July "
"2022 so there are multiple packages to choose from if you want to see a real "
"example."
msgstr ""
